Notes
- Golden files live under tests/goldens/perf/ (test-owned; backlog B-108).
- The capture script is not pytest-collected (no test_ prefix; default python_files).
- AT-075/075b captures clip the screen compositor's strips to the #map-canvas
  region, so chrome, toasts, the identity row and the strip cannot leak in.
- App-driven captures use MapperApp(tmp ws under the repo) + run_test(size=(118,34))
  + pilot.press only; helpers _open/_press imported from tests/test_draft_save.py.
- Bytecode cache disabled throughout (-B); pytest ran with -p no:cacheprovider.
